      "path": "oxbow/application/tables/06.astro",
      "content": "---\nexport const excludeFromObfuscation = [\n  \"bg-muted\",\n  \"border-border\",\n  \"text-muted-foreground\",\n  \"sticky\",\n  \"top-0\",\n];\n---\n\n<div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center p-8 mx-auto bg-background\">\n  <!-- copy:start -->\n  <div\n    class=\"w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto overflow-hidden bg-background border rounded-lg border-border\"\n  >\n    <div class=\"overflow-auto max-h-80\">\n      <table class=\"min-w-full text-xs bg-background\">\n        <thead\n          class=\"sticky top-0 z-10 bg-background text-foreground\"\n        >\n          <tr>\n            <th class=\"px-3 py-2 font-medium text-left\">ID</th>\n            <th class=\"px-3 py-2 font-medium text-left\">Title</th>\n            <th class=\"px-3 py-2 font-medium text-left\">Owner</th>\n            <th class=\"px-3 py-2 font-medium text-left\">Updated</th>\n            <th class=\"px-3 py-2 font-medium text-right\">Items</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          {\n            Array.from({ length: 40 }).map((_, i) => (\n              <tr class=\"even:bg-background\">\n                <td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-muted-foreground\">#{i + 1001}</td>\n                <td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-foreground\">\n                  Collection {i + 1}\n                </td>\n                <td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-muted-foreground\">\n                  owner{i % 7}@example.com\n                </td>\n                <td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-muted-foreground\">\n                  2025-09-{String((i % 28) + 1).padStart(2, \"0\")}\n                </td>\n                <td class=\"px-3 py-2 font-mono text-right text-foreground tabular-nums\">\n                  {(i * 3) % 50}\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            ))\n          }\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- copy:end -->\n</div>\n"
    }
